# Antigravity & Agent Rules

## Styling Rules
1. **Interactive Elements:** All buttons (`<button>`) and clickable non-link elements must display a pointer cursor. Tailwind v4 gives buttons `cursor: default` and `globals.css` does not override it, so add `cursor-pointer` explicitly.
2. **Buttons:** Disabled buttons must have `cursor-not-allowed` and an opacity reduction.

## Workflow Rules
- Always verify design aesthetics before committing frontend changes. Look for ways to make the design more premium.
- The full, current rules live in `.agents/AGENTS.md` and `.agents/skills/`; follow them where this file is silent.

## SEO & Indexing Rules
1. **Indexed Pages:** Every public, indexable page MUST explicitly export `metadata` containing `title`, `description` and `keywords`. No exceptions.
2. **Authenticated/Private Pages:** Any authenticated or private page (e.g. everything under `/admin`) MUST have `robots: { index: false, follow: false }` and MUST NOT contain SEO metadata like `description` or `keywords` (only a `title` for the browser tab).
